His latest book is The Hidden History of American
Oligarchy Reclaiming Our Democracy from the

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.179
Ruling Class.

00:00:15.179 --> 00:00:16.720
Always great to have you on time.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:17.869
Thanks, David.

00:00:17.869 --> 00:00:19.580
It's great to be here with you.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:24.529
So let's let's go back a little bit, as you
always do in the books, and talk about the

00:00:24.529 --> 00:00:28.650
