00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:40.120
With Orben, it was the Syrian refugees flooding
into Hungary and his and it produced both

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:43.700
an economic and a social political crisis.

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:50.940
And his first the first thing that Orban did
