00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:55.570
an autocrat was to say that he was going to
build a wall along the southern border of

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.770
Hungary to keep out the Syrian refugees.

00:07:57.770 --> 00:08:01.300
He actually built that wall, by the way.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:06.300
And, you know, and it's amazing, the whole
chapter in my book about this, how Trump basically

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:10.500
is following was following Orban's playbook,
blow by blow by blow.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:13.970
I mean, it was just just breathtaking.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:18.180
And so, you know, it's a crisis usually that
precipitates that.

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:23.510
What is it that distinguishes an oligarch
from simply a billionaire or a multi multi

00:08:23.510 --> 00:08:24.510
millionaire?

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:25.680
Is it a political power component?

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:29.380
Is it something about the political system
