00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:34.219
Generally speaking, I mean, the definition
is subject to popular whim.

00:08:34.219 --> 00:08:40.860
There are dictionary definitions for an oligarch
typically described as a very wealthy person.

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:45.970
But but I think in in this context and certainly
