00:08:55.970 --> 00:09:01.480
increasing their own wealth, but seizing the
political power and process in a way that

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:06.589
will increase their own wealth and guarantee
the continuation of their wealth and their

00:09:06.589 --> 00:09:08.139
