00:09:19.189 --> 00:09:20.990
of this in the United States.

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:27.920
Some might argue that a combination of an
additional many decades of entrenchment of

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:34.600
power among the few in the United States,
combined with the media apparatus that's fomented

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:42.250
by high speed Internet and the sort of fragmentation
